{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_17_level_spst_17-01","storyGroup":"main_17","storySort":284,"storyDependence":"main_17_level_spst_17-01","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"EG-11","storyName":"时间之后","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"普瑞赛斯借凯尔希的眼睛，重新审视着这个年幼的文明。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_spst_17-01","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"spst_17-01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":22,"characters":[]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_bg_60_g1_rhodescorridor_bc.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_sys_act1mainss_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act1mainss/m_sys_act1mainss_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"Dr.{@nickname}，还在挑选那些诗集吗？","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"没什么，我刚才想到了一首诗，也可以放入其中。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"你想让我念给你听吗？","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"charslot","id":15},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_60_g3_cvilizationtombstone.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"sticker","id":19,"multi":"true","text":"倘若群星燃烧着关怀我们的激情，","x":"300","y":"230","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":20,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n我们却无法回报，我们作何感想？","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":21,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n现在我看群星，我却难以启齿，","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":22,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n说我成天思念一颗星星。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":23},{"type":"sticker","id":24,"multi":"true","text":"倘若所有的星星消失或者消亡，","x":"300","y":"230","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":25,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n我应该学会仰望空荡的天空，","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":26,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n同时感受宇宙一片漆黑的崇高，","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":27,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n虽然这样可能要花费一点时间。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":28,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n......","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":31},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":34},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":35},{"type":"text","text":"原来......这就是你一万年的旅程。","id":36},{"type":"text","text":"我该如何重新认识你，AMa-10......","id":37},{"type":"text","text":"或者说......凯尔希？","id":38},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":40},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":41},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_bg_60_g4_rhodesabyss_w.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"你的行为对源石计划造成了不小的阻碍，但是跟着你的视线，或许是了解如今的泰拉文明最直接的方式。","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"原来如此......","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"PCS系统，保存者的维生舱，幸存的巨兽，破损的星门......那些破碎遗迹，竟然是以这种方式塑造了新生文明的样貌。","id":48},{"type":"text","text":"出人意料的结果，却因过于荒唐而显得有趣。","id":49},{"type":"text","text":"但最重要的是，源石改变了这些生命的样貌，也引导他们走上了与我们的文明相似的路。","id":50},{"type":"text","text":"Dr.{@nickname}，从塔卫二召唤来的生命火种是你自作主张的选择，这样的结果符合你的期待吗？","id":51},{"type":"dialog","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"charslot","id":55},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_bg_bg_23_G07.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"text","text":"我看到了......","id":59},{"type":"text","text":"原始而远离危机的环境为生命保留了野蛮生长的空间，演化出了形态各异的文明，这是失落时代许久不曾见到的景象......","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"它的确令人感动，我并非无法理解。","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"可是，难道就仅此而已？","id":62},{"type":"dialog","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_bg_bg_cenbri.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"text","text":"你曾经还记得的，我们经历过多少次被寄予厚望的计划在末日中灰飞烟灭，我们的同胞为了冲破终极的黑暗前赴后继地牺牲。","id":70},{"type":"text","text":"所剩不多的希望被无休止地消磨，那是极度的残忍。","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"相比之下，在这颗渺小的星球上，这个还会因语言和文化产生隔阂，因为政治而爆发战争的原始文明，如何能算得上“希望”？","id":72},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"charslot","id":76},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"text","text":"我不明白，到底是什么说服了你......","id":80},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_49_i22.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":85},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"40","block":"false","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_27_i31.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":93},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"40","block":"false","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":97},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"charslot","id":100},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_44_i12_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":101},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"40","block":"false","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":107},{"type":"image","id":108},{"type":"verticalbg","imagegroup":"66_i18_4/66_i18_3/66_i18_2/66_i18_1","solidwidth":"1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","y":"1200","id":109},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"50","yFrom":"1200","yTo":"0","block":"false","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"verticalbg","imagegroup":"38_g17_2/38_g17_1","solidwidth":"1280","solidheight":"1116.25/1117.5","x":"0","y":"920","id":117},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"13","yFrom":"920","yTo":"0","block":"false","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":119},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"verticalbg","id":126},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_49_i07.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":127},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"40","block":"false","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"原来......","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"在被文明荒废的漫长时间里，也有这些堪称伟大的时刻留下痕迹，如同那些迅速熄灭的恒星。","id":133},{"type":"text","text":"多么难得啊，陆不再执着于她天真的计划，就连弗里斯顿也选择交出了希望。","id":134},{"type":"text","text":"AMa-10，这就是你留恋的？","id":135},{"type":"text","text":"原来这就是你的理由......Dr.{@nickname}。","id":136},{"type":"text","text":"只是因为你在他们的文明中，看到了与我们相似的挣扎？","id":137},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"image","id":141},{"type":"charslot","id":142},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_bg_60_g4_rhodesabyss_w.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":144},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":145},{"type":"text","text":"可是，这还不够，远远不够。","id":146},{"type":"text","text":"我理解你的情感，但这不足以让我为他们的存续让出空间。","id":147},{"type":"text","text":"我们的时间不多了，源石的生长还需要更多土壤与时间，而末日近在眼前。","id":148},{"type":"text","text":"如果......如果你相信他们最终能够揭开那道帷幕，那他们也理应能够跨过眼前这些不值一提的障碍，超过他们自身。","id":149},{"type":"text","text":"尽管向我证明吧。","id":150},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":153},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"image","id":155}],"characters":[]}